{"page_id": "rotation_skew-rse3bb77cb_rot270-p1", "markdown": "# Page 9610 of 10444\n\nFrom:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\n@uscp.gov>\n\nDate: January 1, 2021 at 10:02:05 PM EST\n\nTo: (b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nCID)\"\n\n@usss.dhs.gov>\n\nSubject: 12.30.20\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nGood evening (D)6)\n\nHope you enjoyed a happy and healthy new year. Below please find a\n\nreport submitted to the FBI for your visibility:\n\n--New iSalute Message-\n\nTime of Submission: 2020/12/30 05:00:32\n\nCategory: Other (Informational Information)\n\nDescription: Hello my name is Sergeant\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nand I am a DACP Desk Sergeant\n\nwith the Ft. Leonard Wood Military Police. And during my shift I received a phone call at the Military Police Desk from a\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nHe was wanting to report that he\n\nhad a hunch that on January 6, 2021 that there would be a chemical or biological attack in\n\ninauguration. I would like to make sure that this gets reported/known.\n\n.--Submitter Information-\n\nFirst Name:\n\n(b)(6)\n\nMiddle Name:\n\n(b)(6)\n\nLast Name:\n\n(b)(6);\n\n(b)(7)(C)\n\nCitizenship: Citizen\n\nPrimary Phone:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nPrimary Phone Type: Cellular\n\nAlternate Phone:\n\nAlternate Phone Type:\n\nCity/Base: FT. Leonard Wood\n\nState/Country: Missouri\n\nEmail Address:\n\nSpecial Agent\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nUnited States Capitol Police\n\nCriminal Investigations Section\n\nFBI Cyber Task Force Officer\n\nOffice:\n\n(b)(6), (b)()(C)\n\nPrimary:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\n@uscp.gov\n\nAlternate (b)(6);\n\n@fbi.gov", "width": 2200, "height": 1700, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "Page 9610 of 10444", "bbox": {"x": -1.1186964081372647e-05, "y": 761.4583318576389, "width": 24.798730337293446, "height": 177.08333333333326}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "From:", "bbox": {"x": 207.84204315463722, "y": 1337.8410773160497, "width": 29.234898147951558, "height": 80.3456854820251}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)", "bbox": {