": "--New iSalute Message-", "bbox": {"x": 538.7253592849564, "y": 1051.6055051053306, "width": 32.23235672414784, "height": 290.9694306055705}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Time of Submission: 2020/12/30 05:00:32", "bbox": {"x": 612.8824238734551, "y": 892.4999947583333, "width": 28.341432162912973, "height": 524.1666666666667}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Category: Other (Informational Information)", "bbox": {"x": 648.6526799619091, "y": 860.4824270707055, "width": 32.45427550900963, "height": 556.3452180226644}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Description: Hello my name is Sergeant", "bbox": {"x": 726.2479666690806, "y": 924.3749938463544, "width": 28.341425405800315, "height": 492.29166666666663}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)", "bbox": {"x": 719.1626339675249, "y": 736.6666651791666, "width": 24.79872526945892, "height": 148.75000000000003}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and I am a DACP Desk Sergeant", "bbox": {"x": 726.247965015229, "y": 308.12499610416677, "width": 28.341423716521994, "height": 389.58333333333326}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "with the Ft. Leonard Wood Military Police. And during my shift I received a phone call at the Military Police Desk from a", "bbox": {"x": 750.1778240196236, "y": 317.9566206440271, "width": 85.65045447357227, "height": 1103.301150004069}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)", "bbox": {"x": 793.5587692332256, "y": 800.4166647630208, "width": 28.341398377349314, "height": 152.29166666666669}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "He was wanting to report that he", "bbox": {"x": 804.1867716286885, "y": 290.4166624166668, "width": 28.341427095078508, "height": 425}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "had a hunch that on January 6, 2021 that there would be a chemical or biological attack in", "bbox": {"x": 832.5281312234931, "y": 297.4999887375003, "width": 35.42682905703936, "height": 1126.25}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "inauguration. I would like to make sure that this gets reported/known.", "bbox": {"x": 914.0096161543844, "y": 538.3333245145838, "width": 28.341467637754704, "height": 881.8749999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": ".--Submitter Information-", "bbox": {"x": 988.4057834809436, "y": 1041.2499969541666, "width": 24.798738783684236, "height": 304.58333333333337}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "First Name:", "bbox": {"x": 1062.8019255037568, "y": 1278.5416652854167, "width": 24.798724424819884, "height": 138.12500000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6)", "bbox": {"x": 1052.1739111770664, "y": 1186.4583327666664, "width": 24.798715133789873, "height": 56.66666666666666}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Middle Name:", "bbox": {"x": 1095.8946646134466, "y": 1224.926282708925, "width": 31.201174024990387, "height": 192.19232241312662}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6)", "bbox": {"x": 1094.6859885012746, "y": 1175.833332861111, "width": 24.798715133789873, "height": 56.66666666666666}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Last Name:", "bbox": {"x": 1137.1980616760932, "y": 1278.5416648958333, "width": 24.798723580180848, "height": 141.66666666666674}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6);", "bbox": {"x": 1130.1127187355405, "y": 1189.99999946875, "width": 24.79871682306807, "height": 63.749999999999964}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(7)(C)", "bbox": {"x": 1158.4541026359364, "y": 1175.8333322708331, "width": 21.256045404455627, "height": 85.00000000000007}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Citizenship: Citizen", "bbox": {"x": 1176.167459817565, "y": 1179.3749976270835, "width": 24.798733715849774, "height": 237.29166666666657}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Primary Phone:", "bbox": {"x": 1208.7750050848279, "y": 1224.9331877991926, "width": 34.337584177652914, "height": 192.32310295104972}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)", "bbox": {"x": 1218.6795421800855, "y": 1044.7916648072917, "width": 21.256052161568405, "height": 148.75000000000003}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Primary Phone Type: Cellular", "bbox": {"x": 1250.5635857922352, "y": 1051.874993920139, "width": 24.79874807471425, "height": 364